exported to user by <code>SceDriverUser</code>

For example used by store_checkout_plugin, sqlite_vsh.

This creates a mount point that can be used as a filesystem. 

Only valid appmgr mount ids are:
* <code>0xC8</code>: ur0:temp/sqlite
* <code>0xC9</code>: ur0:temp/attach
* <code>0xCA</code>: ux0:pspemu
* <code>0xCB</code>: ?
* <code>0xCC</code>: ur0:temp/checkout
* <code>0xCE</code>: ur0:temp/webbrowser

